  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 1.06,
      "e": 4.76,
      "text": "- So this is our 306th Guardian Angel Operations Building."
    },
    {
      "s": 4.76,
      "e": 6.28,
      "text": "We're currently in six different buildings"
    },
    {
      "s": 6.28,
      "e": 7.62,
      "text": "spread across the base,"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.62,
      "e": 10.42,
      "text": "and this new building consolidates us into one facility."
    },
    {
      "s": 11.57,
      "e": 13.81,
      "text": "So this new building brings everybody together,"
    },
    {
      "s": 13.81,
      "e": 16.14,
      "text": "and all those support sections are now just down the hall,"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.14,
      "e": 17.92,
      "text": "so the morale's gonna go way up."
    },
    {
      "s": 17.92,
      "e": 20.97,
      "text": "It improves teamwork and communication"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.97,
      "e": 23.4,
      "text": "between the different support sections,"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.4,
      "e": 25.7,
      "text": "so overall, it's gonna be really good for the squadron."
    },
    {
      "s": 26.86,
      "e": 29.52,
      "text": "So the construction began about 18 months ago,"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.52,
      "e": 32.76,
      "text": "and we are projecting to have it complete in June 1st."
    },
    {
      "s": 34.28,
      "e": 36.71,
      "text": "It's a big project, 65,000 square feet,"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.71,
      "e": 38.73,
      "text": "so that's why it's taken a little bit longer than expected,"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.73,
      "e": 41.32,
      "text": "but it's on track right now and it's looking pretty good."
    }
  ],
